     2475       apply "VALUE-CHANGED" to BR-dis-dc-rule.
     2476   end.
     2477   define variable vss-include-info15 as character format "x(65)" no-undo initial "@(#)$Workfile$ $Revision$".
     2478   on F9 of frame Dialog-Frame anywhere do:
